lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# `bin/` and `registry/` are committed on purpose. They are generated, but they
# are also served: the registry has to be reachable over HTTP for
# `--registry <url>` to work against this repo, and a committed `bin/` is what
# lets `npx github:owner/repo` run without a build step. CI rebuilds both and
# fails if the committed copies have drifted.
*.tgz

